---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ThemeToggle from '../components/react/ThemeToggle';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Student Opportunity Intelligence Platform">
  <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 transition-colors">
    <!-- Navbar -->
    <header class="px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white/70 dark:bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-20">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-sky-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-black text-lg shadow-md shadow-sky-500/20">
          🎓
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="font-bold text-sm tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Opportunity</span>
          <span class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 font-bold text-sm ml-1">Intelligence</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <ThemeToggle client:load />
        <a
          href="/login"
          class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700"
        >
          Sign In
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Legal Content -->
    <main class="flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-6 py-12">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 dark:bg-sky-950/60 dark:text-sky-300 border border-sky-200 dark:border-sky-800/60 mb-2">
          📜 Legal Agreement
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
          Effective Date: October 2026 • Version 2.0.0
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p>
            By creating an account, browsing opportunity listings, using multi-agent automated matching, or generating application documents through the Student Opportunity Intelligence Platform (&quot;SOI&quot;, &quot;we&quot;, &quot;platform&quot;), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not access or use the platform.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            2. Platform Purpose & Autonomous Discovery
          </h2>
          <p>
            SOI employs a decentralized fleet of 15 specialized AI agents to crawl authorized public university web domains, official Higher Education Commission (HEC) portals, and foundation listings. Opportunities are verified using cryptographic canonical hashing, domain trust-tier validation, and human-in-the-loop verification queues.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            While we strive for 100% accuracy, opportunity deadlines, funding allowances, and eligibility criteria are set by the respective sponsoring bodies (such as HEC, foreign embassies, universities, or corporate sponsors). Users must review official application portals prior to submission.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            3. Academic Integrity & Accurate Profiles
          </h2>
          <p>
            Users are required to provide accurate information regarding their university sector, semester, CGPA, and domicile district. Misrepresenting academic standing or regional eligibility undermines the integrity of transparent matching recommendations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            4. Prohibited Conduct
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
            <li>Attempting to bypass authentication, rate-limiting guards, or Row-Level Security barriers.</li>
            <li>Deploying denial-of-service or scraping attacks against platform endpoints.</li>
            <li>Uploading falsified or malicious documents into the Application Preparation Studio.</li>
            <li>Using automated bots to trigger orchestrator pipelines without administrative authorization.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            5. Intellectual Property & Application Prep Materials
          </h2>
          <p>
            Documents generated by the Application Preparation Agent (including Statement of Purpose frameworks, attested document checklists, and recommendation letter outlines) are provided for academic assistance. The scholar retains full ownership of their personal essays and submitted application materials.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            6. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <p>
            SOI is provided on an &quot;as-is&quot; and &quot;as-available&quot; basis. The platform and its developers assume no liability for missed deadlines, scholarship committee decisions, sponsor funding reductions, or external portal outages.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            7. Termination & Account Deletion
          </h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate academic honesty or platform security rules. Users may permanently terminate and delete their account at any time via the self-service Account Deletion feature.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:underline">← View Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/" class="hover:underline">Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="py-6 px-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
      Student Opportunity Intelligence Platform • Terms of Academic Service
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>
